==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Electric Keese Wings are dropped by [[Electric Keese]] upon their defeat. Like other [[Monster Part]]s, they can be [[Cooking|Cooked]] with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be sold to [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]] or used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Yellow Dye]].

Electric Keese Wings are required to [[Enhancing|Enhance]] the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:

{{Material Armors|BotW|Electric Keese Wing}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
The [[Climbing Set]] requires Electric Keese Wings to be [[Enhancing|Enhanced]] to its second tier by a [[Great Fairy]].

{{Material Armors|TotK|Electric Keese Wing}}

==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[File:AoC Electric Keese Wing Icon.png|right|100px]]
Electric Keese Wings can often be obtained by defeating [[Electric Keese]]. They can be used to raise the [[Weapon]]-level limit of a Weapon, remove any or all [[Seal]]s on a Weapon, Octo-Polish a Weapon, or complete certain [[Quest]]s. They can also be commonly sold for six [[Rupee]]s, though they can be sold to [[Segimo]] for 15 Rupees.
{{Noncanon|End}}

